Third-party software
--------------------

ForkPilot does not contain ArduPilot or PX4 code. It checks out, builds and runs a
separate checkout of them, which the user provides:

- ArduPilot (https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot) is licensed under GPL-3.0.
  ForkPilot's autotest suite imports ArduPilot's own test code from that checkout
  at run time.
- PX4 Autopilot (https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot) is licensed under BSD-3-Clause.

Exceptions in this repository:

- bench/real/patches/*.diff are changes to ArduPilot source files. They are
  derived from ArduPilot and are licensed under GPL-3.0, not Apache-2.0.
- bench/make_fork.py contains short ArduPilot source lines that it uses as
  anchors to edit a local ArduPilot checkout.
- tests/data/auto_mission_small.bin is a DataFlash log recorded from ArduPilot SITL.
- tests/data/impact/ holds excerpts of ArduPilot source files and diffs of
  ArduPilot commits, used as test fixtures. They are derived from ArduPilot and
  are licensed under GPL-3.0, not Apache-2.0.
